# ==============================================================================
# CAREER BRIDGE - ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: GMAIL SMTP (Recommended - Free, No Domain Needed)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Buka akun Google Anda -> Keamanan -> Verifikasi 2 Langkah (Aktifkan).
# 2. Cari "Sandi Aplikasi" (App Passwords) -> Buat sandi baru untuk "CareerBridge".
# 3. Masukkan email Gmail dan 16 karakter sandi aplikasi di bawah:
EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-16-char-gmail-app-password
EMAIL_FROM="Career Bridge ITS" <your-email@gmail.com>

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: RESEND API (Free 3,000 emails/month)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dapatkan API key gratis di https://resend.com
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
